NATIONAT ASSEM BLY SECRETARIAT
ORDERS OF THE DAYfor the meeting of the National Assembly to be held on Thursday, the 13th November, 2025 at4.00 p.m.
1. Tilowot, Hodith, Noof and national anthem.
2. Questions entered in a separate list to be asked and answers given.
3. DR. SHARMILA FARUQUI MR. RAMESH LALMR. KHURSHID AHMED JUNEJO to invite attention of the Minister for lnterior, to amatter of urgent public importance regarding 35% surge in cybercrimes in 2025, challenging publicsafety and existing cyber security measures, causing grave concern amongst the public.
4. MR. KHALID MAQBOOL SlDD|QUl, Minister for Federal Education and Professional Training,to move that the Bill to establish the King Hamad University of Nursing and Associated MedicalSciences [The King Hamad University of Nursing and Associated Medical Sciences Bill,2025], aspassed by the Senate, be taken into consideration at once.
5. MR. KHALID MAQBOOL SlDD|QUl, lvlinister for Federal Education and Professional Training,to move that the Bill to establish the King Hamad University of Nursing and Associated lVledicalSciences [The King Hamad University of Nursing and Associated Medical Sciences Bill, 2025], bepa sse d.
5. MR. KHALID MAQBOOT SlDD|QUl, Minister for Federal Education and Professional Training,to move that the Bill to provide for the establishment and management of the Daanish Schools [TheDaanish Schools Authority Bnl, 2025), as passed by the Senate, be taken into consideration at once.
7. MR. KHALID MAQBOOT SlDD|QUl, Minister for Federal Education and Professional Training,to provide for the establishment and management of the Daanish Schools [The Daanish SchoolsAuthority Btl, 20251, be passed.
8. SENATOR AZAM NAZEER TARAR, Minister for Law and Justice, to move that the Billfurther toamend the Qanun-e-shahadat, 1984 [The Qanun-e-shahadat (Amendment) Bill, 7025], as passed bythe Senate, be taken into consideration at once.
9. SENATOR AZAM NAZEER TARAR, Minister for Law and Justice, to move that the Bill further toamend the Qanun-e-shahadat, 1984 [The Qanun-e-Shahadat (Amendment) Bill, 2025], be passed.
10. SENATOR AZAM NAZEER TARAR, Minister for Human Rights, to move that the Bill to amendthe National Commission for Human Rights Act,2012 [The National Commission for Human Rights(Amendment) Bill, 20251, as reported by the Standing Committee, be taken into consideration atonce.
QUESTIONS
CALLING ATTENTION NOTICE
LEGISLATIVE BUSINESS

