11. SENATOR AZAM NAZEER TARAR, Minister for Human Rights, to amend the NationalCommission for Human Rights Act,2012 [The National Commission for Human Rights (Amendment)Bnl, 20251, be passed.
MOTION OF THANKS
L2, Further discussion on the following motion moved by DR. TARIQ FAZAL CHAUDHARY,Minister for Parliamentary Affairs on 12th March, 2025:-
"This House expresses its deep gratitude to the President of the lslamic Republic ol Pakistanfor his address to both Houses assembled together on 10th March, 2025."
MATTERS
OTHER THAN POINTS
OF ORDER
13. Raising matters under Rule 18 which are not Points of Order.
T4, MS. ATIYA KAMRAN MS. SHAHIDA BEGUMMS. NAEEMA KISHWER KHAN MR. JAMES IQBALMOULANA ABDUL GHAFOOR HAIDERI to invite attention of the Minister for lnterior, to amatter of urgent public importance regarding hacking of personal data including WhatsApp and othersensitive information of citizens, causing grave concern amongst the public.
TAHIR HUSSAINSecretary General
CALLING Afi ENTION NOTICE
lslamabad, the12th November, 2025

